// adventures.js — every adventure the party can pick, plus the monster list.
//
// Each adventure has 8 scenes in the same pattern as The Stolen Everlight:
//   intro → solo (learn the boss's weakness) → group check → solo obstacle →
//   solo encounter (secret way in, or raise the alarm) → solo trap → boss → epilogue
//
// Earlier choices change the boss fight:
//   reward: 'inspiration'  success = +1 Inspiration AND the party learns the boss's weakness,
//                          so boss actions with a `weakDc` use that easier DC.
//   reward: 'secret'       success = start the fight with 1 success; failure = the boss
//                          is ready, so the party needs 4 successes instead of 3.
//
// Monster art comes later. For now each monster has an emoji `icon`. When the
// photos of the mini-figures arrive, add an `art: 'img/monsters/<id>.jpg'`
// line to that monster and the picker will show the picture instead.

